{"id":"vod_sn_39289","vodId":"39289","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"迦南","name_cn":"迦南","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e5315b70f5c3329d64e9f079e2b0e598.jpg"},"summary":"《CANAAN迦南》是根据日本视觉小说游戏《428 ～被封锁的涉谷～》改编而成的电视动画。　　涉谷发生大规模恐怖活动事件的2年后，少女迦南在上海接受了对抗犯罪组织的要求，经历著与武装集团“蛇”对抗的日子。犯罪组织“蛇”的首领阿璐法鲁多是过去与迦南共同战斗的伙伴，两人分道扬镳之后，一直潜伏在南亚。 另一方面，自由作家御法川在三流杂志社“heaven出版”与他的助手摄影师玛利亚一同去上海取材，玛利亚感觉到她在中东认识的少女迦南就在附近。混合了繁华和杂乱“魔都”上海，被笼罩在曾经震慑涉谷的病毒阴影之下，人们命运再次开始交织在一起……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g2ErqX8vXN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/arzsDbJAAW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zLbKEHmGaE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UEEe2yV0PV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dyp2mbMWv51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vpqVtvQRbV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jc7Ck3CxV61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GJzUYA9HxT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4an1cD1izH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PQ7Pw9GrZt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kyeHykgB9c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wLdwv8QdBL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/anigq8HNSh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:48.368Z"}